  GW-friction gate pass by architecture, INCLUDING inside halos (where Y != 0).
  FRW quietness (a_mu = 0 comoving => sector off cosmologically): the 1809.03484-class
  graviton-decay kill (|alpha_H| <~ 1e-10) and dark-energy perturbation bounds are evaded by
  construction -- the sector has NO cosmological background to decay into.
  Standard-siren context (pinned approximately, flagged as from-memory values): GW170817-era
  and GWTC-3-era constraints on the friction parameter sit at sigma(alpha_M/c_M) ~ O(0.1-1)
  (e.g. Lagos+ 2019-class analyses; dark-siren H0/friction fits). The u-frame class predicts 0.
  Degeneracy/ghosts: in unitary gauge NO operator carries a time derivative (Y = gam^{ij}
  d_i chi d_j chi exactly; a_i = d_i ln N exactly): the Ostrogradsky question never arises; the
  chi-field is elliptic on the leaves (cuscuton-class precedent). The kill is NOT ghosts.

